      "Both failures are at the same 30-second child readiness wait, before the 100-millisecond timeout-under-test and descendant survival assertion.",
      "Readiness requires both a nonempty child.pid file and existence of child-ready. The panic does not identify which condition failed.",
      "The outer PowerShell process has piped stdout/stderr; these are not consumed until wait_with_output after readiness. No wrapper exit status or child PowerShell error is retained by this assertion.",
